  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO IIEP AIDS&amp;Educatio</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNESCO IIEP AIDS&amp;Educatio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till IIEP/UNESCO i Paris f&#xf6;r projektet &quot;Aids and Education&quot;. St&#xf6;det ges f&#xf6;r en tre-&#xe5;rig &quot;start-up&quot; period, 2000-2002. Projektet har 3 komponenter: 1)etablera ett elektroniskt informations- och databas system, 2)utveckla undervisningsmaterial f&#xf6;r utb.planerare om HIV/AIDS effekter p&#xe5; utb.system,3) studier/forskning om HIV/AIDS. Sida-sekonderad personal till projektet i 9 m&#xe5;nader. (2001/2002)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IIEP/UNESCO, Paris to the &quot;start-up&quot; phase of a project on HIV/AIDS and Education during the period 2000-2002.Project has three components:1)establish a clearing house function,2)develop teaching/learning materials for educ.planners on HIV/AIDS impact on euc.systems,3)conduct case studies/research on the impact of AIDS on education. Sida-seconded staff to the project, 9 months (2001/2002)</narrative>
  </description>
